# Code folding in the text pane: a fold marker on every block that spans lines (here the model
# and the view). Folding hides the lines between the braces; an edit elsewhere keeps the fold, and
# the caret moving into a folded block (selecting from the canvas) unfolds it.
folds
fold 2
fold 9
folds
type // more
folds
select db
folds
fold 9
fold 3
folds
